<title>DENMARK: Danish KommuneKredit raises amount on 4 pct bonds.</title>
<headline>Danish KommuneKredit raises amount on 4 pct bonds.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish KommuneKredit raised an existing four percent bond due 2002 by 55 million crowns to 1.339.065 billion crowns, arranger Gudme Raaschou said in a statement distributed by Copenhagen Stock Exchange on Thursday.</p>
<p>It said that KommuneKredit at the same time raised another existing four percent bond due 1999 by 60 million crowns to 260 million crowns.</p>
<p>It said all the bonds were already sold.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
